type: software
title: "HelmX: AI-Powered Smart Helmet"
abstract: >-
  A smart motorcycle helmet built on a Raspberry Pi 4 that detects crashes and
  drowsiness, guides the rider with voice and navigation, and senses the air
  around them, with an Android companion app and a web store.
